- PENDING.
- APPROVED.
- COMPLETED.
- FAILED.
- CANCELLED.
- OVERDUE.

Do not confuse PayPal order approval with completed payment capture.

## 7.5 Additional Payment Security

- Use idempotency keys where supported.
- Verify PayPal API responses.
- Prevent duplicate payment records.
- Validate payment amounts.
- Validate currency.
- Use database transactions where supported.
- Handle network timeouts.
- Never trust a client-side success message.
- Implement PayPal webhook signature verification if webhook support is included.
- Do not mark an order completed based only on a browser redirect.

